===Etymology===
{{rfe|lang=en}}
From {{etyl|enm|en}} {{m|enm|sprotte}}, from {{etyl|ang|en}} {{m|ang|sprott|}}, cognate with {{cog|de|Sprott}} and {{cog|no|sprot||small rod}}; probably related to ''[[sprout]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/spɹæt/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|æt|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|sprat|sprats}}

# Any of various small, [[herring]]-like, marine fish in the genus {{taxlink|Sprattus|genus|noshow=1}}, in the family [[Clupeidae]].

